146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (Energy consumption forecasting plays a vital role in modern smart cities and sustainable development. This project, AI-Powered Smart Energy Consumption Predictor, focuses on predicting household energy usage using machine learning techniques. The system considers multiple real-world factors such as household size, temperature, air-conditioner availability, and peak-hour usage to estimate total energy consumption. The project integrates a web-based frontend with a Flask-powered backend and a trained machine learning regression mode)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
