<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (With increasing global energy demands and climate change concerns, efficient energy utilization has become critical. Households often lack tools to understand or predict their energy usage. This project addresses this gap by providing an AI-driven prediction system that helps users anticipate consumption and make informed decisions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
