/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 122 0 R
/E (The AI-Powered Smart Energy Consumption Predictor successfully demonstrates how machine learning can be applied to real-world energy management problems. The system accurately predicts energy consumption based on key influencing factors. This project highlights the importance of AI in building sustainable and intelligent systems. With further enhancements and real-world data integration, the model can be scaled for commercial and smart-city applications.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
