299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The AI-Powered Smart Energy Consumption Predictor project successfully demonstrates the use of machine learning techniques in the domain of smart energy management. The main goal of this project was to predict household energy consumption based on important influencing factors such as household size, temperature, air conditioner availability, and peak hour electricity usage. The system effectively meets this objective by providing accurate and reliable energy consumption predictions.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
