301 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (The results obtained from the system reflect realistic energy consumption patterns. Observations show that factors such as household size, temperature, and air conditioner usage have a significant impact on electricity consumption. The project also provided practical experience in machine learning, backend development, frontend design, and API integration.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
302 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (Although the system has certain limitations, such as dependency on dataset quality and lack of real-time data, it serves as a strong foundation for future improvements. Overall, this project highlights the importance of artificial intelligence in energy efficiency and demonstrates how machine learning can be applied to solve real-world problems related to energy management.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
